Okay, so combining characters and ZWJ have 0 width.
This means `sum(map(get_character_cell_size, text))` already correctly calculates the width of a string containing grapheme clusters, because the combining characters and ZWJ contribute 0 to the sum.

So `cell_len` is actually already correct!

